    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8491" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνερεύν-ητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not investigated,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Hp.Ma.</u>
				298c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. παραλιπεῖν τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1181b12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>that cannot be searched</i> or <i>found out,</i>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				421d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνερεύνητα δυσθυμεῖσθαι</span>
			harass oneself about <i>inscrutable things,</i>
			f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				255
			</span></i>.</div>
